---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import GodHero from '../../../components/GodHero.astro';
import GodMarquee from '../../../components/GodMarquee.astro';
import GuaranteeMatrix from '../../../components/GuaranteeMatrix.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="House Remodeling in Valencia and Caracas | RemodelaT" description="High-standard house remodeling for family homes, quintas and townhouses in Valencia, Caracas and Carabobo. Exteriors, kitchens, bathrooms, utilities and…" activePage="services">
  <GodHero
  eyebrow="Houses, quintas & townhouses"
  title="House Remodeling"
  titleGold="for High-Value Homes"
  lead="Interior and exterior remodeling for houses that need technical planning, utility upgrades, premium materials and refined finish control."
  image="/images/arquitectura-600.webp"
  imageAlt="Luxury house remodeling in Venezuela"
  badges={["High Standard", "Technical Method", "Written Warranty"]}
  watermark="FOR HIGH-VALUE HOMES"
/>

<GodMarquee />
  <section class="article-section"><div class="container"><div class="article-body">
    <p>Houses and quintas often involve larger scopes than apartments: façades, roofs, terraces, pools, gardens, service areas, kitchens, bathrooms, utility upgrades and social spaces. The key is coordinating every trade under one technical plan.</p>
    <h2>Typical house remodeling scopes</h2>
    <ul><li>Kitchen and bathroom remodeling with upgraded utilities.</li><li>Flooring, wall coverings and paint systems.</li><li>Façades, roof repairs, waterproofing and exterior finishes.</li><li>Pool and outdoor area upgrades.</li><li>Lighting, electrical capacity and smart-home preparation.</li></ul>
    <h2>Why method matters in houses</h2>
    <p>A house remodel can hide structural moisture, overloaded electrical systems, old plumbing or drainage issues. We identify those conditions before investing in expensive finishes.</p>
    <p><strong>Next step:</strong> <a href="/en/contact">request a technical assessment</a> and tell us the location, approximate square footage and areas to remodel.</p>
  </div></div></section>
  <GuaranteeMatrix lang="en" compact />
  <section class="cta-section"><div class="cta-wrapper"><h2 class="cta-title">Remodel your house with technical control</h2><p class="cta-text">We evaluate the property, define scope and prepare a detailed proposal by trade and finish level.</p><a href="/en/contact" class="btn-premium btn-primary-premium"><span class="btn-content">Request house assessment</span><span class="btn-border"></span><span class="btn-arrow">→</span></a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
